<title>DUBAI: Abu Dhabi approves new Ethylene d-cho.</title>
<headline>Abu Dhabi approves new Ethylene d-cho.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abu Dhabi's Supreme Petroleum Council has approved the construction of a new petrochemical complex to produce ethylene di-chloride (EDC), a statement from the Abu Dhabi National Oil Co (ADNOC) said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
